  "section": "106",
  "quote": "The amount of a rent deposit shall not exceed the amount of one month’s rent, where the rent is payable monthly or less frequently, or the amount of one week’s rent, where the rent is payable on a weekly basis.",
  "reason": "Section 106 limits any required rent deposit to a maximum of one month's rent when rent is payable monthly. Requiring two months' rent as a deposit violates this limit, rendering the provision void."
}

